    "# UK Economic Nowcasting: Strategic Risk Assessment\n",
    "## Analysing Macro-Financial Risk and Stability for Investment Outlook\n",
    "**Candidate Profile:** BSc Economics Final Year, University of Liverpool.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Initiative & Skills Development:** This independent project was undertaken to **develop practical skills in applied Econometrics**, particularly in time-series analysis and financial risk modelling. It utilises Python/Pandas for **Data Analysis-related** applications, demonstrating proficiency in data-driven problem solving.\n"
